---
title: "a reviewed loop, as the phase line reads it"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: open
    lg1: done
    lg2: closed
    lg3: Breaks ReviewReadTheChange in some cases
    lg4: Path to the ReviewReadTheChange bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 tan
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: No change yet
  s1: Changed, check missing
  s2: Closed
  s3: Check failed: fix
  s4: Checked, review missing
  s5: Review found blocking defects: fix
  s6: Complete: close
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you change the code
  s1 --> s3: you run the anchor: it fails
  s1 --> s1: you start a reviewer and wait or you change the code or the reviewer you started comes back: Blocking P0=0 P1=0
  s1 --> s4: you run the anchor: it passes or you declare a passing verify
  s3 --> s1: you change the code
  s3 --> s4: you run the anchor: it passes or you declare a passing verify
  s4 --> s1: you change the code
  s4 --> s3: you run the anchor: it fails
  s1 --> s5: you run the anchor: it passes or you declare a passing verify
  s4 --> s5: the reviewer you started comes back: blocking findings
  s4 --> s6: the reviewer you started comes back: Blocking P0=0 P1=0
  s1 --> s6: you run the anchor: it passes or you declare a passing verify
  s3 --> s5: you run the anchor: it passes or you declare a passing verify
  s5 --> s1: you change the code
  s5 --> s3: you run the anchor: it fails
  s3 --> s6: you run the anchor: it passes or you declare a passing verify
  s6 --> s1: you change the code
  s6 --> s3: you run the anchor: it fails
  s5 --> s6: the reviewer you started comes back: Blocking P0=0 P1=0
  s6 --> s2: you close the loop [every todo done or given a followup]
  s6 --> s5: the reviewer you started comes back: blocking findings
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
